            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Section 8 presents an expanding-window out-of-sample forecasting exercise, together with Fama–MacBeth and portfolio-sort robustness checks. Section 9 discusses economic mechanisms and practical implications for portfolio managers and market makers. Section 10 concludes.",
